+;   Left stick click=64  Right stick click=128  LB=256  RB=512  A=4096  B=8192  X=16384  Y=32768
+;   LT=9  RT=10   (triggers use these special SKSE codes, not XInput bits)
+;   Sticks (GamepadRightStickMask): left=11  right=12.   0 disables a binding.
